{"slug":"Free-Client-Script-Executor-*BACK*-kill-player-Deadly-74576","_id":"693d06d09b445894f4c98070","title":"kill player Deadly","game":{"_id":"68966c2c1db541b05096cd52","gameId":14113053169,"name":"Free Client Script Executor *BACK*","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-f65f0ab404c585bcc443b18ad26b6cfe-6a8aef318dc9.png","placeId":14113053169},"features":"Hola este es un Script de kill player Con DisplayName (Necesitar herramientas)\nCoordenadas=CFrame.new(149.100845, -36.748093, 15074.002930)\n\nEsto Telenstransporta ati en el bloque de Deadly\nY Mata Al jugador que Agarraste\n\n!Problemas Arreglados!\n\ncreditos:Automated_Account","tags":["WorkspaceRejectCharacterDeletions","Kill player"],"script":"--[[Necesita Herramienta]]\n\nlocal target = \"DisplayName\"\n\nfor _, v in pairs(game.Players:GetPlayers()) do\n\tif v.DisplayName:lower():sub(1, #target) == target:lower() then\n\n\t\tlocal tchar = v.Character\n\t\tif not tchar then return end\n\t\tlocal thrp = tchar:WaitForChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n\n\t\tlocal plr = game.Players.LocalPlayer\n\t\tlocal char = plr.Character\n\t\tlocal hum = char:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"Humanoid\")\n\t\tlocal hrp = char:WaitForChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n\n\t\tlocal cam = workspace.Camera\n\t\tlocal anim = char.Animate\n\n\t\tlocal clone = hum:Clone()\n\t\tclone.Parent = char\n\t\thum:Destroy()\n        clone.BreakJointsOnDeath = false\n\t\tcam.CameraSubject = char\n\t\tanim.Disabled = true\n\t\tanim.Disabled = false\n\n\t\tif plr.Backpack:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"Tool\") then\n\t\t\tclone:EquipTool(plr.Backpack:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"Tool\"))\n\t\telse\n\t\t\tclone:UnequipTools()\n\t\t\tclone:EquipTool(plr.Backpack:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"Tool\"))\n\t\tend\n\n\t\tlocal tool = char:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"Tool\")\n\t\ttask.wait(0.2)\n\n\t\tthrp.CFrame = tool.Handle.CFrame\n\t\ttool.AncestryChanged:Wait()\n\n\t\thrp.CFrame = CFrame.new(149.100845, -36.748093, 15074.002930)\n\t\twait()\n\t\tlocal prt = Instance.new(\"Model\", workspace)\n\tend\nend\ntchar:BreakJoints()\n--thum.Health = Editable\nthum.Health = 0\n\nthum:ChangeState(15)","owner":{"_id":"68f872155f8a0dedcfb0a067","username":"SmDoriw_189","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/68f872155f8a0dedcfb0a067-1765338423126.jpg","status":"offline","id":"68f872155f8a0dedcfb0a067","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10}},"verified":false,"views":1428,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/14113053169-1765708574710.jpg","likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-12-13T06:25:20.206Z","editBy":{"_id":"68f872155f8a0dedcfb0a067","username":"SmDoriw_189","status":"offline","id":"68f872155f8a0dedcfb0a067"},"keyLink":"","executes":1104,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"693d06d09b445894f4c98072","editBy":{"_id":"68f872155f8a0dedcfb0a067","username":"SmDoriw_189","status":"offline","id":"68f872155f8a0dedcfb0a067"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-12-13T06:25:20.208Z"},{"_id":"693d117ed77d82777cf055f5","editBy":{"_id":"68f872155f8a0dedcfb0a067","username":"SmDoriw_189","status":"offline","id":"68f872155f8a0dedcfb0a067"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-12-13T07:10:54.472Z"},{"_id":"693d1821ccb38cc427500975","editBy":{"_id":"68f872155f8a0dedcfb0a067","username":"SmDoriw_189","status":"offline","id":"68f872155f8a0dedcfb0a067"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-12-13T07:39:13.108Z"},{"_id":"693dee75d77d82777cfea272","editBy":{"_id":"68f872155f8a0dedcfb0a067","username":"SmDoriw_189","status":"offline","id":"68f872155f8a0dedcfb0a067"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-12-13T22:53:41.198Z"},{"_id":"693e7b9a062c3834e2b3052b","editBy":{"_id":"68f872155f8a0dedcfb0a067","username":"SmDoriw_189","status":"offline","id":"68f872155f8a0dedcfb0a067"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-12-14T08:55:54.831Z"},{"_id":"693e7f01d309229b8e8a389b","editBy":{"_id":"68f872155f8a0de